The test corpora in this directory come from several sources and retain
their upstream licenses. Every imported case was modified to carry the
runner's directive comments (// expect: and friends).

custom/
  Written for this project. MIT, under the repository's LICENSE.

c99/
  From the chibicc test suite (https://github.com/rui314/chibicc).
  MIT License, Copyright (c) 2019 Rui Ueyama.

c-testsuite/
  From c-testsuite (https://github.com/c-testsuite/c-testsuite).
  MIT License, Copyright (c) 2018 Andrew Chambers.

gcc-torture/
  From the GCC testsuite (gcc/testsuite/gcc.c-torture/execute),
  Copyright (C) Free Software Foundation, Inc. GPLv3 or later; see
  gcc-torture/COPYING. These files are test inputs only: nothing in them
  is linked into or derived from the compiler itself.
